F calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record on the middle of the county&rsquo;s grids runs from 1951 to 2025, and October to November came in under 90% of normal in 38 of those 75 years. On the middle of the grids, November to December 2025 came in at 27% of normal and July to August 2025 at 65%. So far in 2026, February to March came in at 53% of normal on the middle of the grids. Grid 17854 had its driest year in 1963 at 64% of normal.</p>"}
